-- Logo: base64-encoded PNG for the Diagnostics/About page.
-- To use a default logo, read the appropriate file and paste its full contents below:
--   Third Floor Systems: assets/logos/third-floor-systems-banner.b64
--   Sweetwater:          assets/logos/sweetwater-integrations.b64
-- To use a custom logo:
--   [System.Convert]::ToBase64String([System.IO.File]::ReadAllBytes("path\to\logo.png"))
